WEBVTT

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.270
Mr. Yevgraf.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:20.440
Well...

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.990
It seems your partner managed to escape.

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:29.540
That's fine.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.700
One would suffice.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.630
You're awake, Mikhail.

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:44.680
You're about to meet the master we adore,

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.220
yet you've been sleeping all this time.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.060
I'm so excited that I cannot sleep at all.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:59.020
<i>What I saw then never leaves my mind.</i>

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.480
Oh, we're beginning to see it.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:06.030
<i>But after today, even that will...</i>

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.220
Oh, Master Yevgraf.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:37.560
What an honor
to actually have you welcome me like this.

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:40.150
Mikhail. I've been longing to see you.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.020
Lonely without me, were you?

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:45.030
How...?
How dare you speak to him in that tone?

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.780
You never change, do you?

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.450
Oh, yes, yes. Let's go...

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:53.990
But... Excuse me...

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:57.330
Mikhail. Let's go together...

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:00.080
to the last hope of the Vampires...

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:03.170
the Ark of Sirius.

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:58.790
It sure is cold.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:02.660
I guess we're both a bit odd
for moving to Sakhalin in this season.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:06.590
Well, I wouldn't be able to do this
if my family didn't come with me.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.170
I completely understand.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:16.760
Yevgraf is probably close
to finding the Ark.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:18.890
Or perhaps he already has.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.060
What? How could he?

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.810
-The old document?
-Yes.

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:28.400
The original print was excavated
a few centuries ago

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.320
from the ruins
where the Sirius allegedly once prospered.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:34.650
I wasn't able to decipher everything,

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:38.450
but the Ark of Sirius was mentioned in it.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.790
It explained what the Ark is,

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.460
and how it was passed down to posterity.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.500
By the time Yevgraf attacked Dogville,

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.840
the Ark had already been taken away
by someone.

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:52.010
By my father.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.470
Nobody knew where the Ark went,
so, it seemed like

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:58.180
the Vampires had hit a dead end.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.430
But they did not give up.

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:05.440
Does that mean they finished deciphering
the entire document?

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:09.310
And did they find something
that indicated the location of the Ark?

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:11.150
That's a logical conclusion.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.440
They must have applied
my deciphering patterns.

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:18.820
Yuliy.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.370
I have thus far concentrated
on exterminating Vampires.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.670
As atonement for what I did
to you and Dogville.

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:30.460
Professor...

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:35.880
<i>South Sakhalin.</i>

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.430
<i>That's where I'll find Yevgraf.</i>

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:41.600
<i>And the Ark of Sirius.</i>

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:53.360
It's hard to believe
your younger brother was a Jaeger,

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.030
working together with the professor.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:06:00.990
He must be about your size by now, no?

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.700
How is that question helpful in any way?

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:07.660
I ordered you to kill Jaegers on sight.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:14.710
You had many opportunities to kill him,
yet you did nothing.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:19.470
You must really love your little brother.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:32.730
What's this?

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:37.240
Ancient characters,
once used by the Sirius.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:38.900
Sirius characters?

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.160
A long time ago,

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:45.160
the civilization of the Sirius began here,
on this land.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:49.160
Thus,
this is the sacred land of the Sirius.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.790
And that's
why your father brought the Ark here.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.250
-What?
-It is written on the wall here

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:59.220
that this is the birthplace
of the Ark of Sirius,

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:03.680
and that this is the only place
where the Ark could be sealed.

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:04.600
Sealed?

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:07.390
Father never said anything about that.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:11.310
Did he tell you that he would come back
as soon as he hid the Ark?

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:17.940
But your father never returned
to Dogville.

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:23.110
And you will soon find out why, Mikhail.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:35.500
What is this place?

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.880
Your father, the inheritor of the Ark,

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:43.840
carried out a truly heroic act
for the Sirius.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:48.260
Your father used the Ark
to create a mechanism

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.980
where nobody can possibly know
what will happen

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:54.690
if anyone, whether human or Vampire,
gets any closer to the Ark.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:59.070
And he sacrificed his life doing so.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:00.990
My father did this?

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:05.200
It's an eternal seal
that nobody could ever break.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:10.950
But with you,
a fellow Sirius and beloved son,

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.660
that may not be the case.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:18.040
It's the dramatic reunion
of father and son.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:31.680
<i>Somewhere here...</i>

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:46.740
<i>So, Yuliy went to South Sakhalin,</i>
<i>all by himself,</i>

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:49.950
to look for this Ark of Sirius?

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:51.580
That's likely the case.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.910
He acts swiftly, as usual.

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:56.710
But he didn't have to leave
without saying anything.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:09:00.000
-Calm down now.
-I told you not to touch my hair.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:04.340
I never thought of him as the type
to go after such a mysterious object.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.090
For him,
it doesn't matter what's inside the Ark.

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:11.100
Finding the Ark has become the purpose
of his life now, probably.

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.640
And we have nothing to do with it,
is that it?

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:18.770
Professor, are you sure
we should leave Yuliy alone like this?

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:22.570
No doubt that he's competent,
but working alone seems too dangerous.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.820
Is it because it's an order?

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.110
-Philip.
-Returning to the headquarters

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.280
is more important than Yuliy, is that it?

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:30.830
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.700
-But why?
-However...

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.710
we need to go somewhere first.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.830
We'll do what we can do.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:05.490
Please, call me when you've decided.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.900
Young lady. Bring me some sake.

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:11.530
All right. Aren't you drinking too much,
too early in the day?

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:14.160
Whatever.
I can't stand life without drinking.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.540
-Welcome.
-Welcome.

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:27.130
Don't do it.

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:32.050
Don't pull out anything dangerous
in a place like this.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:37.270
But I like your taste.

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:40.600
The food here is the best
in South Sakhalin.

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:43.190
Don't worry, it's on me,

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:46.610
so, you needn't threaten me like a dog,
Yuliy Jirov.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:48.570
Who are you?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:51.030
Bishop. I'm one of you guys.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:53.620
A Jaeger?

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:14.850
<i>This is where Father rests with the Ark.</i>

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:19.390
<i>Father sealed the Ark,</i>
<i>sacrificing his life.</i>

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:22.480
<i>Yet it is I who will break that seal?</i>

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.060
What are you waiting for?

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:28.150
Bring your adorable father up from there.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.990
<i>Forgive me, Father.</i>

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:32.490
The Ark.

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.950
<i>If only I had the Ark, I could...</i>

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:51.090
<i>Father. Why?</i>

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:16.370
<i>Father, please.</i>

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:18.240
<i>Allow me...</i>

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:22.660
<i>Allow me to take the Ark.</i>

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:33.510
That's enough. Come back, Mikhail.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.510
I refuse.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.780
Stop... it.

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:56.740
You can't die just yet. It'd be no fun.

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.290
Do not...

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:06.580
get in my way.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:11.880
You're so defiant to your master,
as usual.

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.220
I've never considered you my master.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:18.470
It must be the proud Sirius blood
that makes you behave this way.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:19.890
However...

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:25.730
the blood pact we formed

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.810
can even make that surrender.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.070
Consequently,

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:40.780
your father seems
to have denied you completely.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:47.080
But what if we use
your adorable little brother?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:50.880
Annihilated?

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.050
Calm down.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:57.430
Were all the other Jaegers killed?

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:02.810
Come on, don't be so worried.
I'm still alive.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:06.230
I'll be damned.
I asked Headquarters for backup,

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.520
and you're the only person
that they send me.

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:09.520
I'm not it.

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:12.360
I didn't come here as a Jaeger.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:16.360
Which means you're
here for the Ark of Sirius.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:18.950
Why?

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:22.200
We're in the same business.

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:25.240
I tend to find out
about other Jaegers' backgrounds.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.580
I know that you're a survivor of Sirius,
for example.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.040
How much do you know?

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:34.420
Chasing Yevgraf is what led me to the Ark,
that's all.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.970
-Disappointed?
-No.

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:40.430
So, then what do you think about this?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:44.560
I plan to meet a person
who knows where the Ark is.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.930
You want information on the Ark.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:50.850
I will find the Ark before Yevgraf,

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:54.400
make him watch me destroy it,
and then I'll kill him, too.

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.780
You see,
our goals are practically the same.

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:00.280
You want to work together?

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:03.200
It's always better to have more manpower.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:06.410
All right.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:09.710
But the Ark is important for my tribe.

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.830
I can't have you destroy it.

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:24.010
Mr. Yevgraf. You're back. How did it go?

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:30.440
No good, I take it.

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:35.230
Mr. Yevgraf, please, wait.
We have no time to waste.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:38.940
Now that we know that it's difficult
to obtain the Ark,

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.200
even with a Sirius,
we only have one choice.

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:43.700
Just one. Please, wait.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:48.490
Allow me to take this opportunity
to display the fruit of my great research.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:50.460
My research.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:55.040
The... The total destruction
of the prototype was certainly unexpected,

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:58.500
but I can start mass production
as soon as you give me permission.

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:02.050
Mr. Yevgraf, please.

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:07.140
Mr. Yevgraf...

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.390
I swear...

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:16.020
I swear that I will show you

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:18.230
that my research is good.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:23.780
Nothing but my research
will save the future of Vampires.

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:27.280
On an autumn night...

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:30.330
he who leaves The Imperial Capital
is the foreigner.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:37.250
Those people were like a typhoon.

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:41.210
Now, Ryoko would at least behave properly.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.760
Master.

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:45.510
-What's with the commotion?
-I... I found this.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.220
DEAR FATHER

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:52.850
<i>"Dear Father,</i>
<i>I do myself the honor to address you.</i>

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:59.270
<i>Having packed my bag,</i>
<i>I shall finally part for London."</i>

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.820
<i>Father, I must leave.</i>

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:07.070
<i>Please, forgive me for having left</i>
<i>without saying anything.</i>

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.120
<i>As the next head of the Naoe Family,</i>

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.540
<i>I must examine the cause of the tragedy</i>
<i>that devastated our family.</i>

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.370
<i>With a strong mind</i>
<i>and ceaseless efforts...</i>

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.960
"I shall accomplish this goal
and return home.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.130
Please, be well until that day.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:25.220
Sincerely, Ryoko."

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.760
What...? What shall we do?

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:34.310
"Let your beloved child travel," they say.

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.100
All right, let's go.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:40.730
-What? Go where?
-Where do you think? To London.

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:43.320
But you just said,
"Let your beloved child travel."

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.780
Who said you can't
go with your traveling child?

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:48.240
Oh, well... I see.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:54.790
PRIME MINISTER AMBUSHED

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:57.580
<i>Getting sent to South Sakhalin</i>
<i>in a situation like this</i>

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:59.750
<i>seems like a diplomatic form of demotion.</i>

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:07.470
<i>Hell awaits me if I go forward,</i>
<i>and hell awaits me if I go back.</i>

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:11.390
<i>At any rate, it's all up to the Ark,</i>
<i>how things will turn out.</i>

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:16.480
I must get energized to prepare
for the long journey ahead of me.

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.360
It's freezing tonight.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:48.550
Winter has arrived early this year.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.980
Can't believe someone knows about the Ark
this deep in the mountains.

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:00.980
The stubborn old man is infamous
for his dislike of people.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.190
He might not be willing to talk.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:08.690
So, what's your weapon?

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.950
Is that darn stick going
to help you at all?

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:16.370
Who taught you?

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.500
The leader of your group?

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:21.080
-I taught myself.
-For crying out loud.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.960
But the professor has taught me
a lot of other things.

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:28.130
Reading and writing, many languages,
and also...

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.010
How to kill Vampires?

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.930
He's some professor,
having taught you such a thing

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:35.470
since you were so young.

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:43.310
Later today,
I will probably fight together with you.

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:45.940
So, I want to ask you something,
before that happens.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.900
What? Don't you dare ask me
if I know how to handle a gun.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.740
I've been smelling blood from you
this whole time.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.530
The same smell as them.

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:59.870
Are you really a Jaeger?

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.880
When you're in this business
for a long time,

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:10.380
the smell of Vampires gets on you,
and it won't come off.

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:12.970
I use my cigar as cologne.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:18.930
I knew that one day I was going to pay
for all the Vampires I've killed.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:22.810
But I wasn't expecting
to pay for all of them at once like this.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.190
Are you talking about
your dead colleagues?

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:26.110
Yeah.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:29.570
I spent more time with them
than with my family.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:33.490
-I think you know what I'm talking about.
-Yes.

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:37.030
That's why I came to Sakhalin alone.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.250
Hey. We're almost there.

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:45.250
Look out.

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:54.840
Damn monsters.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:03.930
Let me handle this, Yuliy.

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:08.060
Are you all right?

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:23.080
I'm Larisa.

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:25.000
I'm Tamara.

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:35.130
You're Misha's little brother, right?

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:36.430
You don't look like him.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:39.220
Would you like to be a Vampire, too?

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:41.760
You'd be able to play with Misha again.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:43.270
Stop this nonsense.

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:50.440
-Why?
-Why are you upset?

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:52.230
Do you hate us?

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:55.070
Because we killed the villagers?

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:57.200
Because you're the only Sirius left?

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.660
-Shut up.
-A Sirius?

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:02.030
Because your mother was killed?

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:04.370
Misha became a Vampire, you know.

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:07.620
Had Master Yevgraf not bitten Misha,
he would have died.

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:11.590
-I know, right?
-It was Yevgraf who...

